                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oku nikwo baabaganisiize oruganda rwa Manaase, ahabw'okuba omujigaijo gwa Yosefu. Kandi Makiri omujigaijo gwa Manaase, ishenkuru wa Gileadi, akaheebwa ebyanga bya Gileadi na Bashani, ahakuba akaba ari emanzi omu ngamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi baijukuru ba Manaase abaatsigaireho baababaganisiza, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri; abo nibo, Abiezeeri, Heleki, Asirieli, Shekemu, Heferi, na Shemiida, batabani ba Manaase mwene Yosefu, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
