              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.1+NUM.27.2+NUM.27.3+NUM.27.4+NUM.27.5+NUM.27.6+NUM.27.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 27:1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka Zelofehaadi mwene Heferi, mwene Gileadi, mwene Makiri, mwene Manaase, tarazaire boojo, kureka abaishiki; kandi aga nigo maziina gaabo, Maala, Noa, Hogula, Milika na Tiruza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baimuka baashanga Eleazaari omunyamurwa, na Yoshua mwene Nuuni, n'abakuru b'eihanga, baagira bati: MUKAMA akaragiira Musa kutuha obuhunguzi na banyaanyaitwe. Nikyo Yoshua yaabaheereire obuhunguzi na beene ishe, nk'ekiragiro kya MUKAMA oku kyabaire kiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamanaase baaheebwa ebicweka ikumi, otabariiremu ebyanga bya Gileadi na Bashani seeri ya Yorudani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahabw'okuba bahara ba Manaase bakaheebwa obuhunguzi na baanyaanyabo; kandi Abamanaase abandi baaheebwa ekyanga kya Gileadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwatano gw'ekyanga ky'Abamanaase gukaba gutandikira Asheri, guhika Mikemeesa, eri kureeba Shekemu; gugumizamu aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, guhika omu bantu abatwire Eni-tapua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ekyanga kya Tapua kikaba kiri ekya Manaase, kwonka Tapua aha mwatano gwa Manaase ekaba eri ey'Abaefuraimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gutyo omwatano gushuuma, guhika aha kagyera Kaana aha rubaju rwako rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo; endembo ezo zikaba ziri ez'Abaefuraimu ahagati omu ndembo za Manaase; kandi omwatano gwa Manaase gukaba guri aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho bw'ako kagyera; nigugarukira aha Nyanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo ekaba eri eya Efuraimu, kandi aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho eri eya Manaase; n'enyanja ekaba eri omwatano gwe; kandi aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho baahika aha kyanga kya Asheri, kandi oburugwa-izooba bahika aha kya Isakaari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omu byanga bya Isakaari na Asheri, aba Manaase bakaheebwa Besi-sheani na tauni zaarwo, Ibuleamu na tauni zaarwo, n'abantu abatwire Doori na tauni zaarwo, n'abatwire Endoori na tauni zaarwo, n'abatwire Tanaki na tauni zaarwo, n'abatwire Megido na tauni zaarwo, nibyo bibungo bishatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.29+EXO.23.30+EXO.23.31+EXO.23.32+EXO.23.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 23:29-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka aba Manaase tibarabaasize kubinga abantu abaabaire batwire omu ndembo ezo, kureka Abanyakanaani bakenda kuguma batwire omu nsi egyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka Abaisraeli ku baaherize kuhama, baakoresa Abanyakanaani emirimo y'obuhuuku, tibaababingiramu kimwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
