              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baijukuru ba Yosefu baabuuza Yoshua bati: Ahabwe'enki otuhaire omugabo gw'ekyanga kimwe omu kicweka kimwe kuba obuhunguzi bwaitu; haza turi oruganda ruhango, kandi MUKAMA atuhaire omugisha n'okuhitsya hati? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua yaabagarukamu ati: Ku muraabe muri oruganda ruhango, mwinamukye muze omu kibira ky'omu nsi y'Abaperizi n'aba Reefa, mukyetemere, mweshanze; ahabw'okuba ensi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu efunzire munonga ahariimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 1:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.4.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aba Yosefu baagira bati: Ensi y'ebibungo terikutuhika; kandi Abanyakanaani boona abatwire omu nsi y'empita baine ebigaari by'ebyoma, nibo ba Besi-sheani na tauni zaarwo, n'abatwire omu ruhita rwa Yezereeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua nikwo kugambira ab'omuryango gwa Yosefu, nibo ba Efuraimu n'aba Manaase, ati: N'ekya buzima muri oruganda ruhango, kandi mwine amaani maingi; timushemereire kuheebwa omugabo gw'ekyanga kimwe kyonka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
