        {
          "text": " kureka ensi y'ebibungo eryaba eyaanyu; n'obu eraabe eri ey'ekibira, muryakitema, mukikubuure okuhika aha muheru gwakyo; ahakuba Abanyakanaani, n'obu baraabe baine ebigaari by'ebyoma, kandi bari ab'amaani, muryababinga.",
